  "_about": "Heritage cluster for iDrive 7 plug-in hybrids (made on a 330e G21), generated by tools/gen_dials.py (edit that and regenerate): old and new. Chrome-ringed speedo and tach with dark faces, white numerals and orange needles over a thin BMW i blue band, a classic fuel gauge in the speedo and the hybrid battery in the tach (BMW's gear letter in its middle); between them the date and drive mode, oil and water needles, a trip computer (distance, time, average speed, fuel per 100 km, battery used, estimated electric range) and a status pill: green ALL SYSTEMS OK, amber or red with the reason. Three pdash layers, two dials each. Clock, range and outside temperature along the bottom. Widget reference: shared/hud.js.",
